OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother showery day, with some
OL,6,Fshowers possibly thundery and bringing
OL,7,Fhail, occasionally merging into longer
OL,8,Fspells of rain. Sunny intervals are
OL,9,Flikely between showers, and it will
OL,10,Ffeel fresher than recently.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers gradually easing this
OL,13,Fevening, although a few may continue
OL,14,Fovernight, especially towards the
OL,15,Fwest. Clearer skies will bring a
OL,16,Fchilly night, especially in rural
OL,17,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
