OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FThe odd morning shower
OL,6,Fpossible in the west, otherwise a dry
OL,7,Fand bright day on Saturday with spells
OL,8,Fof sunshine. Temperatures near average.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,11,Fwith sunny spells on Sunday and
OL,12,FMonday, before showers and perhaps
OL,13,Fthunderstorms develop overnight and
OL,14,Finto Tuesday. Feeling warmer,
OL,15,Fparticularly in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
